% Stage 10b: literal Wolfram-axiom instance (corpus expansion).
% The conjecture is the axiom itself with x=p, y=q, z=r so the
% goal-rewrite path applies the axiom rule once at the top and
% reduces lhs to r.  Predicted PROVED @ 0; sanity check that
% the parser + KBO/LPO config handle the axiom's depth-4 NAND
% nesting.  See docs/plans/wolfram_axiom_design.md.
NAME            wolfram_axiom_literal
MODE            PROOF
SORTS           ANY
SIGNATURE       p: -> ANY
                q: -> ANY
                r: -> ANY
                nand: ANY ANY -> ANY
ORDERING        LPO
                nand > p > q > r
VARIABLES       x,y,z : ANY
EQUATIONS       nand(nand(nand(x, y), z),
                     nand(x, nand(nand(x, z), x))) = z
CONCLUSION      nand(nand(nand(p, q), r),
                     nand(p, nand(nand(p, r), p))) = r
